  "examples": [
    {
      "coptic": "ⲉϣⲱⲡⲉ ⲟⲩⲙⲉ ⲡⲉ ⲡϣⲁϫⲉ ⲛⲧⲁⲩⲛⲟϫϥ ⲛⲥⲱⲥ · ϣⲁⲣⲉⲡⲙⲟⲟⲩ ⲉⲧⲙⲙⲁⲩ · ⲧⲣⲉⲡⲉⲥⲥⲱⲙⲁ **ⲕⲱⲕ** ⲉⲡⲥⲱⲃϩ ·",
      "english": "If the offence wherewith she is charged hath been actually committed, that water shall make her body to become covered with burning pustules (and) leprosy.",
